## Things to know
- **Superseded rows stay in review:** SUPERSEDED doesn't clear the REVIEW status. Here the two rows disagree on park, so you need to decide which answer is right. Keeping the first is only a default.
- **Phone comparison limitation:** the "answers differ" check compares *cleaned* values. Two different bad phone numbers (both `REVIEW`) look identical to it, so a phone-only difference between duplicates won't trigger `DuplicateDiff`. The `Phone` reason will still fire for each row.
